            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "الفندق جميل، إلا أن الغرف صغيرة. al-funduq jamīl, illā anna al-ghuraf ṣaghīra. The hotel is beautiful, but the rooms are small."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "More formal than لكن."
            }
          ]
        },
