          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "إلا أن (illā anna) joins the native Arabic particles illā, \"except\", and anna, \"that\": except that, and so yet, but. The deeper origin of such particles is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
